      },
      "dc:source": "c2005a00024.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:\n(b) either:\n(i) is provided by a person under a contract with the\nCommonwealth; or\n(ii) is provided by 2 or more persons under contracts with\nthe Commonwealth (with each of the persons providing\na part of the service).",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:\n(b) either:\n(i) is provided by a person under a contract with the\nCommonwealth; or\n(ii) is provided by 2 or more persons under contracts with\nthe Commonwealth (with each of the persons providing\na part of the service).",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2005a00024-sch-1-sec-3-norm"
