    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2005a00024-sch-1-sec-96",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "96 Publication of costs of providing the NRS",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2005a00024#sch-1-sec-96"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2005a00024.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2005a00024.pdf, p.9",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Before the start of each levy quarter, each NRS provider must give\nthe Minister a written estimate of the total cost of the provider in\nproviding the NRS (or part of the NRS) during the quarter. The\nestimate must be prepared in accordance with the relevant NRS\ncontract. The Minister must cause to be published in the Gazette\nthe total amount notified to the Minister under this subsection for\nthe quarter.\n(2) On or before the 21st day of the third month after the end of each\nlevy quarter, each NRS provider must give the Minister a written\nstatement of the total cost of the provider in providing the NRS (or\npart of the NRS) during the quarter. The statement must be\nprepared in accordance with the relevant NRS contract. The\nMinister must cause to be published in the Gazette the total amount\nnotified to the Minister under this subsection for the quarter.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Before the start of each levy quarter, each NRS provider must give\nthe Minister a written estimate of the total cost of the provider in\nproviding the NRS (or part of the NRS) during the quarter. The\nestimate must be prepared in accordance with the relevant NRS\ncontract. The Minister must cause to be published in the Gazette\nthe total amount notified to the Minister under this subsection for\nthe quarter.\n(2) On or before the 21st day of the third month after the end of each\nlevy quarter, each NRS provider must give the Minister a written\nstatement of the total cost of the provider in providing the NRS (or\npart of the NRS) during the quarter. The statement must be\nprepared in accordance with the relevant NRS contract. The\nMinister must cause to be published in the Gazette the total amount\nnotified to the Minister under this subsection for the quarter.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2005a00024-sch-1-sec-96-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2005a00024-sch-1-sec-96-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6ea53eec929a7d2c6fde3a629938414d797a1eac9ec4a88df8eac51052db9157"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2005a00024#sch-1-sec-96",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "96 Publication of costs of providing the NRS",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 9,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Before the start of each levy quarter, each NRS provider must give\nthe Minister a written estimate of the total cost of the provider in\nproviding the NRS (or part of the NRS) during the quarter. The\nestimate must be prepared in accordance with the relevant NRS\ncontract. The Minister must cause to be published in the Gazette\nthe total amount notified to the Minister under this subsection for\nthe quarter.\n(2) On or before the 21st day of the third month after the end of each\nlevy quarter, each NRS provider must give the Minister a written\nstatement of the total cost of the provider in providing the NRS (or\npart of the NRS) during the quarter. The statement must be\nprepared in accordance with the relevant NRS contract. The\nMinister must cause to be published in the Gazette the total amount\nnotified to the Minister under this subsection for the quarter."
    },
