      "skos:definition": "(1) Before the start of each levy quarter, each NRS provider must give\nthe Minister a written estimate of the total cost of the provider in\nproviding the NRS (or part of the NRS) during the quarter. The\nestimate must be prepared in accordance with the relevant NRS\ncontract. The Minister must cause to be published in the Gazette\nthe total amount notified to the Minister under this subsection for\nthe quarter.",
