    {
      "@id": "concept:c2005a00024-sch-1-sec-96-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "96(2) Publication of costs of providing the NRS",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2005a00024#sch-1-sec-96-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2005a00024.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2005a00024.pdf, p.9",
      "values:originalText": "(2) On or before the 21st day of the third month after the end of each\nlevy quarter, each NRS provider must give the Minister a written\nstatement of the total cost of the provider in providing the NRS (or\npart of the NRS) during the quarter. The statement must be\nprepared in accordance with the relevant NRS contract. The\nMinister must cause to be published in the Gazette the total amount\nnotified to the Minister under this subsection for the quarter.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) On or before the 21st day of the third month after the end of each\nlevy quarter, each NRS provider must give the Minister a written\nstatement of the total cost of the provider in providing the NRS (or\npart of the NRS) during the quarter. The statement must be\nprepared in accordance with the relevant NRS contract. The\nMinister must cause to be published in the Gazette the total amount\nnotified to the Minister under this subsection for the quarter.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2005a00024-sch-1-sec-96"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2005a00024-sch-1-sec-96-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2005a00024-sch-1-sec-96-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "74746be0b178f3ec3ded09cadbb4967c20d86f1b0d1d25273b8767de3da96724",
      "skos:note": "Must provide written statement of costs to Minister by a certain date.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2005a00024#sch-1-sec-96-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "96(2) Publication of costs of providing the NRS",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 9,
      "values:originalText": "(2) On or before the 21st day of the third month after the end of each\nlevy quarter, each NRS provider must give the Minister a written\nstatement of the total cost of the provider in providing the NRS (or\npart of the NRS) during the quarter. The statement must be\nprepared in accordance with the relevant NRS contract. The\nMinister must cause to be published in the Gazette the total amount\nnotified to the Minister under this subsection for the quarter."
    },
